{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00405","headline":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 雍和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烂云普洽，律风无外。\n千品其凝，九宾斯会。\n禋尊晋烛，纯牺涤汰。\n玄覆攸广，鸿休汪濊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}